<view class="page">
  <view class="row"><view class="title">领地地图</view><text class="badge" wx:if="{{sandbox}}">道路回放 · 非真人 GPS</text></view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="card welcome"><view class="section-title">登录后记录跑步</view><view class="subtitle">完成实际跑步闭环后，计算占领、加固与削弱。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{sandbox}}" bindtap="login">微信登录</button><view class="notice" wx:if="{{sandbox}}">当前服务用于浏览器道路回放；小程序实际跑步需连接正式 GPS 环境。</view></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{state.player.removedReason}}">你已离开旧匹配池。下一次有效闭环将重新匹配，历史活动保留。</view>
    <view class="territory card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">我的领地</text><text class="badge">{{state.pool ? state.pool.name : '未入池'}}</text></view><view class="area">{{state.displayArea}}<text> km²</text></view><view class="row muted small"><text>当前占领 {{state.player.ownedCells}} 格</text><text>满级加固 {{state.player.fortifiedCells}} 格</text></view></view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{state.player.damage === 2}}">下一次有效闭环，对手领地伤害 ×2。加固与占领不翻倍。</view>
    <view class="map-card"><view class="row map-title"><text class="section-title">领地地图</text><text class="muted small">{{nearbyCount}} 人正在附近跑步</text></view><map id="territoryMap" latitude="{{center.latitude}}" longitude="{{center.longitude}}" scale="16" polygons="{{polygons}}" markers="{{markers}}" bindregionchange="regionChange" enable-zoom="{{true}}" enable-scroll="{{true}}" style="width:100%;height:650rpx"></map><view class="small muted" wx:if="{{limitedCells}}" style="padding:16rpx 26rpx 0">优先绘制附近 900 格，平移查看更多；统计包含全部领地。</view><view class="legend"><text><text class="legend-dot mine"></text>我的领地</text><text><text class="legend-dot rival"></text>同池对手</text><text><text class="legend-dot neutral"></text>中立区域</text><text>对边 50 米</text></view></view>
    <view class="run-cta"><view class="subtitle">{{state.activeActivity ? '有一场未结束的跑步' : '至少 600 米 · 3 分钟 · 闭环后结算'}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="goRun">{{state.activeActivity ? '查看当前跑步' : '开始跑步'}}</button></view>
    <view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">同池跑友</text><text class="muted small">{{state.pool ? state.pool.members.length : 0}} / 6 人</text></view><view class="member" wx:for="{{state.pool.members}}" wx:key="id"><view class="avatar" style="background:{{item.color}}">{{item.name}}</view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.ownedCells}} 格{{item.source === 'road-replay' ? ' · 道路回放' : ''}}</text></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="prepareInvite">邀请朋友同池</button></view>
    <view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="goHistory">我的跑步</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleRules">玩法说明</button></view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{showRules}}">圈住中立地：占领并加固 1 层。<br/>重复自己的路线：加固 +1，上限 3。<br/>圈住对手：伤害 1，首次入场或停跑满 3 天后的首圈伤害 2。<br/>降到 0 变中立，下次闭环再占领。<br/>同一人每天同一格只生效一次。<br/>停跑满 14 天或旧地被完全占领：移池重匹配。<br/>好友优先同池，仍需部分重叠与空位；异池互不影响。</view>
  </block>
</view>
<canvas type="2d" id="markerCanvas" style="position:fixed;left:-200px;top:-200px;width:64px;height:64px;pointer-events:none"></canvas>
<view class="privacy" wx:if="{{invite}}"><view class="privacy-inner"><view class="title">邀请朋友同池</view><view class="subtitle">朋友完成部分重叠的实际闭环后，池内有空位即可优先同池。邀请不增加数值。</view><button class="primary" open-type="share">发送给微信朋友</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyInvite">复制浏览器邀请链接</button><button bindtap="closeInvite">回到地图</button></view></view>
<view class="privacy" wx:if="{{privacyRequired}}"><view class="privacy-inner"><view class="title">定位用途说明</view><view class="subtitle">本次跑步需要持续定位来形成闭环并结算领地。附近位置默认不公开，原始轨迹仅本人可见。</view><button id="privacyAgree" class="primary" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agreePrivacy">同意并继续</button><button bindtap="rejectPrivacy">暂不同意</button></view></view>
